# =============================================================================
# VanillaLand — exclude non-VoIP content to keep context focused on feature parity
#
# NOTE: Patterns use ../VanillaLand/ (sibling workspace root). If Claude Code
# doesn't resolve cross-root paths from this file, create a .claudeignore in
# the VanillaLand directory itself mirroring these entries.
#
# What stays visible (VoIP/telephony reference):
#   AppCode/VanillaSoft.Backend/  ConnectMeVoice, SMS, Phone*, Recording, Routing*, Customer
#   AppCode/VanillaSoft.Model/    VoIP, SMS, Recording, Contact/CallHistory, PhoneNumber, Customer
#   AppCode/Vanillasoft.Webservice/  (ASMX contracts Carameli's REST API replaces)
#   AppCode/ConnectMeVoice/          (CMV client — call + message-drop API surface)
#   AppCode/CMV*                     (agent status, call data, recordings services)
#   AppCode/InBoundMessaging*/       (inbound SMS webhook patterns)
#   AppCode/SMSService/              (SMS processing queue)
#   AppCode/VoipLineCountUpdate*/    (line usage tracking)
#   AppCode/vsoft_CallComplianceSvr/ (call compliance)
# =============================================================================

# ── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vue 3 + Kendo UI — completely different tech stack; not feature reference
../VanillaLand/AppCode/VanillaSoft.Vue/

